 into a paper defect log at the gatehouse\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_a.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Stated directly in the source with different capitalization of the opening word.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-003\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"The duty officer walks the north corridor every weekday from 7 am till 8 am, right after the shift handover\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_a.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Stated directly in the source document.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-004\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"A second round covers the workshop and the paint store from 13:05 till 16:20 hours on Wednesdays only\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_a.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Stated directly in the source document.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-005\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"The site manager has asked for a third round for years\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_a.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Stated directly in the source document.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-006\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"the budget has never allowed it\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_a.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Stated directly in the source; 'it' refers to a third round as established in context.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-007\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"Frost swells the timber frames on the older doors\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_a.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Stated directly in the source document.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-008\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"between November and February several of them will not latch unless pulled hard\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_a.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Stated directly in the source using 'them' to refer to the older doors.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-009\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"Once the frames dry out in spring, the same doors close cleanly again\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_a.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Stated directly in the source; 'the same doors' refers to the older doors previously discussed.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-010\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"the doors are the responsibility of the site\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_a.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Stated directly in the source document.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-011\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"the certified inspection is carried out by an outside contractor who attends every March 1st to March 31st\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_a.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Stated directly in the source document.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-012\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"the contractor tags each door\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_a.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Stated directly in the source document.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-013\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"photographs the closer\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_a.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Stated directly in the source document.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-014\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"leaves a signed certificate at the gatehouse for the auditors\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_a.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Stated directly in the source document.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-015\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"whoever finds a defect writes it in the log\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_a.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Stated directly in the source document.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-016\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"pins a yellow card to the door itself\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_a.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Stated directly in the source document.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-017\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"The card stays there until the repair is signed off\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_a.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Stated directly in the source document.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-018\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"In most cases it is a tie, because one officer clears both at the end of the week\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_a.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The source states the card and record are cleared in a tie; 'at the same time' restates this meaning.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-019\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"The chess club has met in the small canteen on Tuesday lunchtimes\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_b.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Stated directly in the source document.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-020\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"it was started by two apprentices from the drawing office\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_b.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Stated directly in the source document.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-021\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"The club does not meet between mid July and early September\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_b.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Stated directly in the source document.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-022\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"Play resumes on the first Tuesday of term\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_b.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Stated directly in the source document.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-023\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"Over the years the members have learned to leave the boards set up rather than pack them away\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_b.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Stated directly in the source document.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-024\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"the club runs a simple ladder that anyone may join at any point\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_b.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Stated directly in the source document.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-025\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"Members who win a game move up one place\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_b.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Stated directly in the source document.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-026\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"the person they beat moves down one place\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_b.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Stated directly in the source document.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-027\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"In one wet autumn the club was invited to play a county side\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_b.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Stated directly in the source document.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-028\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"one apprentice agreed to play on the top board at two days' notice\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_b.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Stated directly in the source document.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-029\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"It took him the whole weekend to prepare\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_b.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Stated directly in the source using 'him' to refer to the apprentice.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-030\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"he studied openings he had never used\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_b.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Stated directly in the source document.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-031\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"He also lost his notes on the train\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_b.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Stated directly in the source document.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-032\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"But he arrived on time\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_b.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Stated directly in the source document.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-033\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"He shook hands\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_b.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Stated directly in the source document.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-034\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"sat down\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_b.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Stated directly in the source document.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-035\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"the apprentice was a pawn ahead\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_b.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Stated directly in the source document.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-036\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"offered a draw\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_b.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Stated directly in the source document.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-037\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"which the county side accepted\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_b.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Stated directly in the source document.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-038\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"the county side gave the club enough spare clocks to run every board on the ladder at the same time\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_b.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Stated directly in the source document.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-039\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"He travelled home\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_b.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Stated directly in the source document.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-040\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"told everyone in the drawing office about the game\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_b.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Stated directly in the source document.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-041\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"the club grew to thirty members\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_b.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Stated directly in the source document.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"M-042\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"from then on the canteen staff put out an extra table every Tuesday\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"source_b.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Stated directly in the source document.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```","ttft_ms":160036,"type":"result","duration_ms":181968,"uuid":"fdaa516a-81b4-4720-8b32-99dd27d7d53a","ttft_stream_ms":883,"time_to_request_ms":94,"first_content_frame_ms":884,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
